# Kona, Rescue Beastie: "you may put a permanent card from your hand". Turn 3: Kona attacks; the hand holds only Lightning Bolt
# and a third drawn: no permanent card, so the trigger asks nothing (the refusal) and the hand is unchanged. Turn 5: Kona
# attacks again (it untapped in the untap step) with a Forest drawn into the hand; the choice is offered and Bot1 declines it
# by choosing none ("may"): the Forest stays in hand.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Kona, Rescue Beastie
Lightning Bolt
Lightning Bolt
Lightning Bolt
Forest
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp x14

